[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to an Unrestricted File Upload vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the OpenAPI schema and the described implementation involve accepting user-uploaded files (images) without explicitly mentioning any validation or sanitization of the uploaded content. If the application does not properly validate the file type, size, or content of the uploaded files, an attacker could upload malicious files, such as scripts or executables, which could then be executed on the server or used to compromise the system. This lack of restrictions on file uploads can lead to unauthorized access, data breaches, or server exploitation.

